WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.602 --> 00:00:04.103
-President-Elect Joe Biden is
continuing with the transition

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:05.271
and announcing cabinet picks.

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:07.907
Meanwhile, outgoing president
squatters rights

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:09.408
fired one of his lawyers

00:00:09.408 --> 00:00:11.544
after she claimed the election
was rigged as part of

00:00:11.544 --> 00:00:13.646
a vast conspiracy involving
the CIA,

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:15.381
the Republican governor of
Georgia,

00:00:15.381 --> 00:00:17.016
and the former president
of Venezuela

00:00:17.016 --> 00:00:18.751
who died seven years ago.

00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:21.120
For more on this, it's time for
"A Closer Look."

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:24.490 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:26.258
You know, I hate to
jump the gun here

00:00:26.258 --> 00:00:27.794
and prematurely call
the election,

00:00:27.794 --> 00:00:30.630
but it's starting to look like
Donald Trump lost by a lot.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:33.065
Joe Biden's popular vote lead is
now over 6 million.

00:00:33.065 --> 00:00:34.968
And in total, he has more votes

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:36.502
than any president-elect
in history.

00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:38.605
Or to put it another,
I don't know, more fun way,

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:40.840
more people came out to vote
against Donald Trump

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.542
than have ever come out to vote
against

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.877
any presidential candidate
in history of the United States.

00:00:44.877 --> 00:00:48.114
And Donald, if you ever get mad
when you see President Biden,

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:50.416
know that it likely only
happened because of you.

00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:53.719
Joe Biden ran for President
a bunch of times before this

00:00:53.719 --> 00:00:55.688
and, like, never finished
in the top tier.

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:58.257
But against you, it turns out
he was the perfect choice.

00:00:58.257 --> 00:01:01.227
Biden was like that weird kid in
school that nobody hung out with

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:02.662
because he smelled like garlic,

00:01:02.662 --> 00:01:04.764
and then a vampire
attacked prom,

00:01:04.764 --> 00:01:07.534
and everyone said,
"Quick! Get Stinky Kevin!"

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:11.204
And he'll never say it, but you
know when Biden told Obama

00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:13.106
he was gonna run for president
again,

00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:15.575
Obama must have thought,
"I'm sorry.

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:17.243
You didn't think being
my vice president

00:01:17.243 --> 00:01:19.745
was the best job you were ever
going to have?

00:01:19.745 --> 00:01:22.381
You thought it was a stepping
stone to bigger things?"

00:01:22.381 --> 00:01:24.350
It's like a Walmart greeter
getting hired and saying,

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:26.385
"One day, I'm going to run
this place!"

00:01:26.385 --> 00:01:28.287
But thanks to Donald Trump,
it happened

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:30.890
because more people came out to
vote against Donald Trump

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:32.424
than have ever come out
to vote against

00:01:32.424 --> 00:01:33.626
any presidential candidate

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:35.194
in the history
of the United States.

00:01:35.194 --> 00:01:37.764
And sure, we all know that in
the back of our minds,

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:39.832
that millions of people did vote
for Donald Trump,

00:01:39.832 --> 00:01:42.735
and that speaks to a great
darkness we cannot fully handle,

00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:44.871
but that thought
isn't going to get you

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:46.572
up and on the Peloton
in the morning.

00:01:46.572 --> 00:01:48.374
So let's just bookmark it.

00:01:48.374 --> 00:01:50.409
On top of Biden's historic vote
totals,

00:01:50.409 --> 00:01:52.078
Georgia just certified
its results

00:01:52.078 --> 00:01:53.712
after a vigorous hand recount,

00:01:53.712 --> 00:01:56.015
and the Trump campaign lost
a major court case

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:57.616
in Pennsylvania where the judge,

00:01:57.616 --> 00:01:59.985
a Republican member
of the Federalist Society,

00:01:59.985 --> 00:02:02.221
did not hold back
in his contempt

00:02:02.221 --> 00:02:04.324
for the Trump legal team's
incompetence.

00:02:04.324 --> 00:02:07.560
-A federal judge in Pennsylvania
completely tearing apart

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:10.096
the Trump legal strategy
that was spearheaded

00:02:10.096 --> 00:02:11.697
by Rudy Giuliani.

00:02:11.697 --> 00:02:13.666
The judge in this case,
Matthew Brann,

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:16.902
tearing apart the claims
by the Trump team

00:02:16.902 --> 00:02:19.672
that they wanted to invalidate
the vote in Pennsylvania

00:02:19.672 --> 00:02:22.542
and throw out nearly
7 million votes.

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:24.577
The judge in this case
saying this...

00:02:46.832 --> 00:02:49.435
-That's about as harsh as it
gets for a federal judge.

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:52.972
That's like hearing
Paul Hollywood say "underbaked."

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:54.474
Just devastating.

00:02:54.474 --> 00:02:57.009
Netflix should really put up a
warning at the top of that show.

00:02:57.009 --> 00:02:59.478
I also like the part where
the judge says you'd expect

00:02:59.478 --> 00:03:01.580
the Trump legal team
to come armed with

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:04.216
compelling legal arguments
and factual proof.

00:03:04.216 --> 00:03:05.752
Judge, take a hint.

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:07.587
When they don't come in
with briefcases,

00:03:07.587 --> 00:03:09.522
lawyers normally have things
with them,

00:03:09.522 --> 00:03:11.357
papers and such called evidence.

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:14.093
They have younger lawyers behind
them with file boxes.

00:03:14.093 --> 00:03:17.463
Rudy and his greasers walk in
with iPhones and CLIF Bars

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:19.165
and a Thermos they all share.

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:22.167
They think this is a high school
forensics team competition

00:03:22.167 --> 00:03:24.737
where the kid with the weirdest
adult energy wins

00:03:24.737 --> 00:03:26.038
by talking longest.

00:03:26.038 --> 00:03:27.906
Why would you expect this crew

00:03:27.906 --> 00:03:29.375
to roll in with proof?

00:03:29.375 --> 00:03:32.345
It's like expecting my burnout
cousin to come to Thanksgiving

00:03:32.345 --> 00:03:33.913
on time with sweet potatoes.

00:03:33.913 --> 00:03:35.714
You know he's going to show up
at 10:00 p.m. with meth

00:03:35.714 --> 00:03:37.416
and a woman he met as a casino.

00:03:37.416 --> 00:03:38.851
Hey. This is Sapphire,

00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:40.619
and she's gonna be
a stripper magician.

00:03:40.619 --> 00:03:42.054
Show 'em your stuff, babe!

00:03:42.054 --> 00:03:45.157
By the way, I don't want to know
how Rudy and his gang

00:03:45.157 --> 00:03:47.960
keep getting court dates to even
bring this to a judge.

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:49.928
They have had multiple days
in court,

00:03:49.928 --> 00:03:51.931
and the election was, what,
three wakes ago?

00:03:51.931 --> 00:03:53.233
Do you know how long it takes

00:03:53.233 --> 00:03:54.934
for regular people to get
a court date?

00:03:54.934 --> 00:03:57.536
In 2017, I was driving a zip car
in Manhattan.

00:03:57.536 --> 00:03:59.138
My dog Frisbee jumped in
the front seat

00:03:59.138 --> 00:04:00.973
and started scanning radio
stations.

00:04:00.973 --> 00:04:02.442
And I was startled,
and I swerved into

00:04:02.442 --> 00:04:03.775
a halal cart near the curb.

00:04:03.775 --> 00:04:05.744
It was the most yelling
ever heard in New York City.

00:04:05.744 --> 00:04:07.413
The halal vendor sued me.

00:04:07.413 --> 00:04:10.716
Zip Car countersued both me
and the halal guy.

00:04:10.716 --> 00:04:13.485
Meanwhile, Frisbee is suing
Sirius satellite radio

00:04:13.485 --> 00:04:15.888
for changing "'40s on 4"
to channel 73,

00:04:15.888 --> 00:04:18.190
the confusion that started this
whole debacle.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.693
This happened three years ago,
and we had a hearing scheduled

00:04:20.693 --> 00:04:25.465
for 2025 and that was only
because I pulled some strings.

00:04:25.465 --> 00:04:27.500
Anyway, I think I was talking
about something.

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:30.202
Oh, right. And now prominent
Republicans such as

00:04:30.202 --> 00:04:31.904
the governors of Arkansas
and Ohio,

00:04:31.904 --> 00:04:33.573
Michigan Congressman Fred Upton

00:04:33.573 --> 00:04:36.175
and Pennsylvania Senator
Pat Toomey are calling Joe Biden

00:04:36.175 --> 00:04:39.044
the president-elect and saying
the transition should begin.

00:04:39.044 --> 00:04:41.780
Even longtime Trump friend and
ally Chris Christie

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:44.549
had this to say about the Trump
legal team's efforts

00:04:44.549 --> 00:04:45.985
to overturn the election.

00:04:45.985 --> 00:04:47.452
-I've been a supporter
of the president's.

00:04:47.452 --> 00:04:49.088
I voted for him twice.

00:04:49.088 --> 00:04:54.226
But elections have consequences,
and we cannot continue to act

00:04:54.226 --> 00:04:57.830
as if something happened here
that didn't happen.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:00.966
Quite frankly, the conduct
of the president's legal team

00:05:00.966 --> 00:05:03.136
has been a national
embarrassment.

00:05:03.136 --> 00:05:05.171
They allege fraud
outside the courtroom,

00:05:05.171 --> 00:05:07.006
but when they go inside
the courtroom,

00:05:07.006 --> 00:05:09.642
they don't plead fraud
and they don't argue fraud.

00:05:09.642 --> 00:05:10.876
If you're unwilling to come
forward

00:05:10.876 --> 00:05:12.011
and present the evidence,

00:05:12.011 --> 00:05:13.946
it must mean the evidence
doesn't exist.

00:05:13.946 --> 00:05:15.881
-You know it's bad when
Chris Christie,

00:05:15.881 --> 00:05:18.284
whose main job for years was
standing behind Trump

00:05:18.284 --> 00:05:20.586
at press conferences like
Bobby Baccalà

00:05:20.586 --> 00:05:22.154
waiting for his next
humiliating errand

00:05:22.154 --> 00:05:23.889
calls you a national
embarrassment.

00:05:23.889 --> 00:05:26.058
But Christie's other point is
important, too --

00:05:26.058 --> 00:05:28.127
Trump's lawyers only claim
there's fraud

00:05:28.127 --> 00:05:29.462
when they're outside
the courtroom,

00:05:29.462 --> 00:05:30.963
never when they're inside
the courtroom.

00:05:30.963 --> 00:05:33.199
Because court is different
from TV.

00:05:33.199 --> 00:05:35.534
In court, you can get in real
trouble for lying,

00:05:35.534 --> 00:05:37.369
but when they're in front of
TV cameras,

00:05:37.369 --> 00:05:39.939
you hear all these Trump lawyers
say crazy, ambiguous,

00:05:39.939 --> 00:05:42.942
debunked stuff about dead voters
and election software

00:05:42.942 --> 00:05:44.577
and affidavits or whatever.

00:05:44.577 --> 00:05:47.746
In fact, in that very hearing,
Rudy Giuliani ultimately lost.

00:05:47.746 --> 00:05:50.316
He seemed confused about
basic legal terms

00:05:50.316 --> 00:05:52.552
like strict scrutiny
and admitted in court

00:05:52.552 --> 00:05:55.254
that the campaign was not
actually alleging

00:05:55.254 --> 00:05:58.224
that fraud had taken place,
which it should be noted

00:05:58.224 --> 00:06:00.259
is like saying in a murder
trial, "Hi,

00:06:00.259 --> 00:06:02.662
I'm the alleged victim,
and I'm still alive.

00:06:20.913 --> 00:06:22.915
-Actually it is a fraud case

00:06:22.915 --> 00:06:24.883
in the sense that it's
a case brought by frauds.

00:06:24.883 --> 00:06:26.785
Like when someone brings
a guitar case,

00:06:26.785 --> 00:06:29.622
they are also probably a fraud.

00:06:29.622 --> 00:06:32.057
It this wasn't a fraud case,
then what was it?

00:06:32.057 --> 00:06:34.660
You guys keep saying there's
voter fraud in public,

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.929
but then not arguing there's
voter fraud in court.

00:06:36.929 --> 00:06:39.064
It's like how you say in front
of your kids,

00:06:39.064 --> 00:06:41.033
"Better be good this year
or Santa might not come."

00:06:41.033 --> 00:06:43.635
And then at 3:00 a.m., you're on
the floor in the living room

00:06:43.635 --> 00:06:46.438
drinking Scotch trying to tie
a bow around a light saber

00:06:46.438 --> 00:06:49.375
screaming,
"[Bleep] paper keeps ripping!

00:06:49.375 --> 00:06:51.343
Aah! Hey, why don't we just
have it, like,

00:06:51.343 --> 00:06:53.646
peeking out from behind
the couch?

00:06:53.646 --> 00:06:57.316
Just like a little piece
of light sab-- All right!

00:06:57.316 --> 00:06:59.685
I'll wrap it.

00:06:59.685 --> 00:07:04.690
Well, I just think it was -- the
thing is they get it as a gift.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:07.459
Okay!"

00:07:07.459 --> 00:07:10.262
In fact, they haven't alleged
any actual voter fraud at all

00:07:10.262 --> 00:07:11.497
because it doesn't exist.

00:07:11.497 --> 00:07:13.031
Instead they've resorted to

00:07:13.031 --> 00:07:16.168
bat-[bleep] crazy conspiracy
theories about election software

00:07:16.168 --> 00:07:17.703
and international communists.

00:07:17.703 --> 00:07:20.072
And you know, one thing
I'm definitely not going to miss

00:07:20.072 --> 00:07:23.341
about the Trump era is the
Mad Libs style news reporting.

00:07:23.341 --> 00:07:25.377
Every time you hear about
something the Trump team said,

00:07:25.377 --> 00:07:28.013
it's like an old Dennis Miller
joke from the '80s.

00:07:28.013 --> 00:07:31.317
[ As Miller ] Brian Kemp
and Hugo Chávez are teaming up

00:07:31.317 --> 00:07:34.286
to steal this election like
Kitty and Peter Carruthers

00:07:34.286 --> 00:07:37.089
going for the gold at Sarajevo.
Okay, babe?

00:07:37.089 --> 00:07:41.727
[ Laughter ]

00:07:41.727 --> 00:07:44.096
[ Normal voice ] Another thing
I won't miss it trying to follow

00:07:44.096 --> 00:07:46.532
the rotating cast of fringe
right-wing weirdos

00:07:46.532 --> 00:07:48.100
that come in and out
of the Trump world.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:50.836
Like you remember this guy,
Joseph diGenova,

00:07:50.836 --> 00:07:53.839
the Trump lawyer and right-wing
lunatic who looks like

00:07:53.839 --> 00:07:56.475
he got busted for trying
to sneak his own pasta sauce

00:07:56.475 --> 00:07:58.043
on to a Pan-Am flight?

00:07:58.043 --> 00:08:00.579
"What you guys got is no better
than ketchup!"

00:08:00.579 --> 00:08:04.550
He basically got banned --
He got banned from Fox News

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:07.686
for anti-Semitism. That's like
getting kicked off Bravo

00:08:07.686 --> 00:08:09.288
for drinking wine in a hot tub.

00:08:09.288 --> 00:08:11.657
DiGenova was briefly
one of Trump's lawyers

00:08:11.657 --> 00:08:13.058
during the Mueller investigation

00:08:13.058 --> 00:08:14.826
and then got dumped
like a week later.

00:08:14.826 --> 00:08:17.763
Even though the only question
he's ever answered is,

00:08:17.763 --> 00:08:20.766
"What if Dennis Franz
wasn't so sexy?"

00:08:20.766 --> 00:08:23.436
He was standing alongside
Rudy Giuliani at that insane

00:08:23.436 --> 00:08:25.971
press conference they held last
week where Rudy re-enacted

00:08:25.971 --> 00:08:27.506
a scene from "My Cousin Vinny"

00:08:27.506 --> 00:08:29.574
and called the Philadelphia
Eagles a basketball team

00:08:29.574 --> 00:08:31.343
and had what looked like
droplets

00:08:31.343 --> 00:08:33.879
of cerebrospinal leaking from
his brain.

00:08:33.879 --> 00:08:36.215
I guess Rudy dyed
his hair frantically

00:08:36.215 --> 00:08:37.716
in a gas station bathroom like

00:08:37.716 --> 00:08:39.652
Richard Kimball
in "The Fugitive."

00:08:39.652 --> 00:08:41.353
I mean, if I saw that
coming out of my radiator,

00:08:41.353 --> 00:08:43.689
I would be pounding
on my super's door.

00:08:43.689 --> 00:08:46.258
Anyway, these are the only
people Trump has left

00:08:46.258 --> 00:08:48.627
because no legitimate lawyer
wants to be a part of this

00:08:48.627 --> 00:08:50.796
unhinged assault
on American democracy.

00:08:50.796 --> 00:08:53.499
In fact, last week the Trump
legal team tried to delay

00:08:53.499 --> 00:08:56.134
that hearing in federal court
to overturn the election

00:08:56.134 --> 00:08:59.171
because in Pennsylvania,
as Reuters reported,

00:08:59.171 --> 00:09:00.973
most of his lawyers quit.

00:09:00.973 --> 00:09:04.075
At this point, the Trump legal
team is like CVS at midnight.

00:09:04.075 --> 00:09:06.712
Sure, they're open, but nobody
actually works there.

00:09:06.712 --> 00:09:09.715
And Trump is like the guy trying
to pay for AriZona iced tea

00:09:09.715 --> 00:09:11.983
at the photo station register
who'll wait for eternity

00:09:11.983 --> 00:09:13.452
and doesn't seem to mind.

00:09:13.452 --> 00:09:17.156
But by far the craziest addition
to the Trump cinematic universe

00:09:17.156 --> 00:09:19.125
has been a lawyer named
Sidney Powell.

00:09:19.125 --> 00:09:21.059
And if you thought Rudy
was bonkers,

00:09:21.059 --> 00:09:24.263
this lady is crazier than
a cereal mascot.

00:09:24.263 --> 00:09:26.532
She was also at the Trump
campaign's press conference

00:09:26.532 --> 00:09:29.168
last week and has been all over
right-ring media claiming

00:09:29.168 --> 00:09:30.769
not just that the election
was rigged,

00:09:30.769 --> 00:09:34.039
but that millions of ballots
were somehow faked or stolen

00:09:34.039 --> 00:09:36.775
or whatever as part of
an elaborate conspiracy

00:09:36.775 --> 00:09:39.845
involving the Republican
governor of Georgia, the CIA,

00:09:39.845 --> 00:09:43.615
and the late Venezuelan leader
Hugo Chávez who died in 2013.

00:09:43.615 --> 00:09:46.518
Until now, Powell might have
been best known playing

00:09:46.518 --> 00:09:49.387
the uptight teacher in
every heavy metal video

00:09:49.387 --> 00:09:52.057
or for going on Lou Dobbs' show
and making claims

00:09:52.057 --> 00:09:54.726
about desperate migrants fleeing
poverty and violence

00:09:54.726 --> 00:09:57.496
that were too insane
even for Lou Dobbs.

00:09:57.496 --> 00:10:00.766
-We simply cannot tolerate the
continued invasion

00:10:00.766 --> 00:10:04.469
of this country when Americans
are suffering every day,

00:10:04.469 --> 00:10:06.205
the national debt is exploding.

00:10:06.205 --> 00:10:08.841
We have diseases spreading
across the country

00:10:08.841 --> 00:10:12.144
that are causing polio-like
paralysis of our children.

00:10:12.144 --> 00:10:13.946
It's one thing after the other.

00:10:13.946 --> 00:10:17.215
-You can't very well blame
that disease

00:10:17.215 --> 00:10:20.853
on illegal immigrants.
We don't know the cause of it.

00:10:20.853 --> 00:10:23.422
I don't know that that's --
I don't think that's fair.

00:10:23.422 --> 00:10:28.194
A lot of, you know --
There are plenty of reasons

00:10:28.194 --> 00:10:29.995
to keep this country secure,

00:10:29.995 --> 00:10:34.367
including making sure
that everyone is healthy

00:10:34.367 --> 00:10:36.935
when they are brought in to
the country without question.

00:10:36.935 --> 00:10:39.872
Right? Is that fair?

00:10:39.872 --> 00:10:42.374
-That is fair, but that is part
of the problem.

00:10:42.374 --> 00:10:45.043
We don't know where the diseases
are coming from.

00:10:45.043 --> 00:10:48.046
-Well, that's -- you know what?

00:10:48.046 --> 00:10:51.116
I think that -- With that,
we're going to leave it.

00:10:51.116 --> 00:10:54.252
-It's always fascinating to
watch these people have a brief

00:10:54.252 --> 00:10:55.654
moment of self-awareness.

00:10:55.654 --> 00:10:57.889
You'd think after that interview
Lou Dobbs would have maybe,

00:10:57.889 --> 00:10:59.324
I don't know,
pulled it back a little?

00:10:59.324 --> 00:11:01.627
It's like when you're at a party
and everyone's feeling good

00:11:01.627 --> 00:11:02.994
and then it gets late
and someone says,

00:11:02.994 --> 00:11:05.163
"Let's get on the roof and jump
in the pool."

00:11:05.163 --> 00:11:07.666
And everybody else says, "Yeah!"
But then you remember

00:11:07.666 --> 00:11:10.302
the apartment is 12 stories high
and there's not a pool.

00:11:10.302 --> 00:11:11.937
So you quietly sneak out
the back.

00:11:11.937 --> 00:11:13.405
But then the next night,
they're like,

00:11:13.405 --> 00:11:14.506
"We're having another party."

00:11:14.506 --> 00:11:16.108
And you're like, "All right."

00:11:16.108 --> 00:11:18.610
Anyway, that's the psycho
who showed up

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:20.846
to the official Trump legal
team's press conference

00:11:20.846 --> 00:11:23.815
on Thursday and claimed not just
the mail-in ballots

00:11:23.815 --> 00:11:26.418
