00:11:26.418 --> 00:11:29.688
but that there was a vast
international communist

00:11:29.688 --> 00:11:32.724
conspiracy involving
a dead Venezuela leader

00:11:32.724 --> 00:11:34.293
to subvert the election.

00:11:34.293 --> 00:11:37.663
-What we are really dealing with
here and uncovering

00:11:37.663 --> 00:11:42.501
