00:11:52.445 --> 00:11:55.480
The Dominion voting systems,

00:11:55.480 --> 00:12:00.018
the Smartmatic technology
software and the software

00:12:00.018 --> 00:12:03.622
that goes in other computerized
voting systems here as well,

00:12:03.622 --> 00:12:08.527
not just Dominion,
were created in Venezuela

00:12:08.527 --> 00:12:11.396
