00:12:31.083 --> 00:12:34.453
-So Powell alleged a vast
conspiracy involving Hugo Chávez

00:12:34.453 --> 00:12:37.055
to help Joe Biden win
the presidential election,

00:12:37.055 --> 00:12:40.258
and yet curiously, she kept
refused to provide evidence

00:12:40.258 --> 00:12:42.461
of this vast scheme when
pressed,

00:12:42.461 --> 00:12:45.897
