who are basically desperate

00:12:45.897 --> 00:12:50.169
to agree with her as long as she
can provide a shred of evidence.

00:12:50.169 --> 00:12:53.738
-So, Sidney, you feel that you
will be able to prove this?

00:12:53.738 --> 00:12:55.841
Do you have the software in your
