00:12:55.841 --> 00:12:57.476
Do you have the hardware
in your possession?

00:12:57.476 --> 00:13:00.512
How will you prove this, Sidney?

00:13:00.512 --> 00:13:03.482
-Well, I've got lots of ways
to prove it, Maria,

00:13:03.482 --> 00:13:07.086
but I'm not going to tell on
national TV what all we have.

00:13:07.086 --> 00:13:09.054
-So we invited Sidney Powell
on this show.

00:13:09.054 --> 00:13:10.455
We would have given her
the whole hour.

00:13:10.455 --> 00:13:12.724
We would have given her
the entire week, actually,

00:13:12.724 --> 00:13:16.094
and listened quietly the whole
time at rapt attention.

00:13:16.094 --> 00:13:18.063
That's a big story.

00:13:18.063 --> 00:13:20.298
But she never sent us
any evidence,

00:13:20.298 --> 00:13:22.701
despite a lot of requests --
polite requests.

00:13:22.701 --> 00:13:24.069
Not a page.

00:13:24.069 --> 00:13:26.104
When we kept pressing,
she got angry and told us

00:13:26.104 --> 00:13:27.772
to stop contacting her.

00:13:27.772 --> 00:13:30.275
-Wow, you know you're in full
loony territory when even

00:13:30.275 --> 00:13:32.545
Tucker Carlson won't go along
with what you're selling.

00:13:32.545 --> 00:13:34.946
He was begging her to come on
his show?

00:13:34.946 --> 00:13:37.215
Good Lord, it's easy to get on
television these days.

00:13:37.215 --> 00:13:40.452
Unhinged people used to have to
